OL,3,GNEWSANetball champions 'excited' by
OL,4,Asport campus plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA top netball coach has said plans for
OL,7,Fa new sports campus linked to a major
OL,8,Fregeneration programme could help
OL,9,Ftackle one of the sport's biggest
OL,10,Fchallenges, a lack of facilities.
OL,12,FIn Oldham, the newly approved Mayoral
OL,13,FDevelopment Corporation could help
OL,14,Fdeliver SportsTown, a proposed health,
OL,15,Fsport and education hub, which includes
OL,16,Fa 3,000 seater arena where Manchester
OL,17,FThunder could play.
OL,19,FIt is among projects which are intended
OL,20,Fto drive investment and regeneration
OL,21,Facross the borough over the coming
OL,22,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
