OL,3,GNEWSANetball champions 'excited' by
OL,4,Asport campus plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FManchester Thunder's Karen Greig, said:
OL,7,F"It definitely pricked our interest and
OL,8,Fwe're excited to see if it's actually
OL,9,Fsomething that can happen."
